# Arguments the pocketone service passes to `pocketone serve` (https://pocketone.dev/docs/linux).
#
# Empty: it listens on 127.0.0.1:8090, for a reverse proxy (Caddy, nginx) in front.
# Your domain(s), space separated: it listens on ports 80 and 443 and gets Let's Encrypt certificates for them.
#
#   SERVE_ARGS=example.com www.example.com
#
# Then: sudo systemctl restart pocketone
SERVE_ARGS=
